    "assignee": null,
    "assignee_team": null,
    "body": "There should be a use before we had some helpers.\r\n\r\nAnd TBH, that 128-bit integer plementation is **not** exactly great, so it's not something that third party code should be rushing to use `libavutil` for. (Using __int128 where available and either 32-bit or 64-bit arithmetic elsewhere would be way more efficient.)",
