    "body": "@Courmisch wrote in https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/21226#issuecomment-19531:\n\n> There should be a use before we had some helpers.\n\nWhole `AVInteger` is used in exactly single place in the code base (except tests) in `avidec.c` https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/src/commit/d828183d2dd9eb6db236c28c54a198b358668a55/libavformat/avidec.c#L487 which is hardly a necessity there to be used. Also while those functions are part of the ABI, the `integer.h` is not added to `HEADERS` and therefore not installed to be used as part of an avutil public API.",
